          "distinct": true,
          "id": "2f906f4188636cbc699eb3fe575addcef8adbf52",
          "message": "test(ui/v2): finish handler test coverage (#125)\n\n* test(ui/v2): finish handler test coverage (closes #110)\n\nAdds unit tests via httptest + the shared store harness for the 8\npreviously-untested /v2/api handlers, each with happy-path plus the\napplicable error/empty paths (missing param -> 400, not-found -> 404,\nnil store -> 500):\n\n- serveResourceCatalog, serveResourceList (resources_test.go)\n- serveObjectRelationships (relationships_test.go)\n- serveObjectHistory (history_test.go, + buildV2WatchStore helper)\n- serveDiff (diff_test.go)\n- serveLogs (logs_test.go)\n- serveEvents (events_test.go)\n- serveTimestamps (timestamps_test.go)\n\nAlso adds TestAllMountedHandlersHaveTests (mount_test.go): a guard that\nscans v2.go's Mount for h.serveXxx handlers and fails if any is not\nreferenced by a test, so new handlers can't silently ship untested.\n\nCoverage of the target handlers is now 79-100%.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ui/v2): guard nil store in remaining handlers; add nil-store tests\n\nserveEvents, serveLogs, serveDiff, serveObjectHistory and serveTimestamps\ndereferenced h.Store without a nil check, so a nil store would panic\nrather than return a structured 500 like the other v2 handlers\n(serveResourceCatalog/serveResourceList/serveObjectRelationships).\nAdd the same \"store not initialized\" guard to all five and cover each\nwith a nil-store test, making the PR's \"nil store -> 500\" hold uniformly.\n\nAddresses Copilot review feedback on #125.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-26T14:11:17-04:00",
