          "id": "6369f754fca5b08c5b7e0c0b7e1c3573ca9c4bd3",
          "message": "docs: regenerate the README demo GIF (#124)\n\nRe-render docs/demo/demo.gif from the current docs/demo/demo.tape against\na freshly built kshrk binary. The previous GIF predated the .khsrk → .kshrk\nextension rename (#108), so it showed stale filenames. The regenerated GIF\nnow shows .kshrk everywhere (capture summary, inspect \"Archive:\" line, the\nopen command) with no .tar.gz/.khsrk artifacts, and inspect reports\n\"Format: v1\".\n\nCloses #118\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-26T14:25:00-04:00",
