          "distinct": true,
          "id": "bf130e9729c07da8867777ed5738c033a12d71aa",
          "message": "feat(ui): dashboard Diagnostics view (PR 3) (#133)\n\nPart of #111. Surfaces the diagnose engine in the web UI.\n\n- /v2/api/diagnostics endpoint runs diagnose.Run over the capture at the\n  resolved time and returns the ranked Report.\n- A \"Diagnostics\" nav item + route + view that renders findings grouped by\n  severity (critical/warning/info) with category, affected object (+grouped\n  count), evidence, and remediation hint; namespaced findings deep-link to\n  the namespace drilldown.\n- Handler tests (findings present + schema_version; nil-store guard).\n\nNote: unifying the overview/namespace \"Issues\" panels onto the engine is\ndeferred to a focused follow-up — it spans two views and needs namespace\nfiltering on the engine, so it's cleaner isolated from this additive view.\nRemaining for #111: that unification, event/log correlation, and docs (PR 4).",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-28T02:48:11-04:00",
          "tree_id": "ffa7855641ac5ef730fb9063b785066f3a82abf0",
