          "distinct": true,
          "id": "2f32a96c9bb645fae509febafe3af952ddfd04a8",
          "message": "chore(ui): remove dead Legacy UI link; drop active-development warning (#145)\n\nThe v1 UI was removed in #91, but the v2 dashboard header still rendered a\n\"Legacy UI ↗\" link to /v1/, which now 404s (confirmed against a running\nserver). Remove the anchor from index.html and its unused .legacy-link CSS.\n\nAlso drop the \"Important: under active development\" warning block from the\nREADME now that the API/archive format have stabilized.\n\nVerified: the served /v2/ dashboard no longer references /v1/ and renders\nnormally; `make build` clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
